  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In a stretch of The Legends of Ren Zu copied inside Imperial Court blessed land, Northern Dark Ice Soul stands before Desolate Ancient Moon and cannot answer why people live. While he ponders, Bewilderment Gu quietly approaches him and makes him lose his sense of the surroundings. Love Gu and disguise Gu approach next. Cognition Gu names this group as famous for mischief and often moving together.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
          "char_northern_dark_ice_soul",
          "char_desolate_ancient_moon",
          "gu_love_gu",
          "gu_cognition_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After love Gu disguises as cognition Gu and sends Northern Dark Ice Soul to search for a nonexistent meaning Gu, love Gu, Bewilderment Gu, and disguise Gu guffaw as he leaves, then take turns toying with him while he keeps searching.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "mischief-with-love-and-disguise",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When cognition Gu later helps him, Bewilderment Gu and disguise Gu are displeased. Cognition Gu tells the young man to use its strength to come to his senses. Northern Dark Ice Soul uses that power, is no longer bewildered, sees through the disguise, and Bewilderment Gu and disguise Gu leave in defeat.",
        "chapters": [
          567
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "mischief-with-love-and-disguise",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
